  "details": "Having a method to retrieve the default or original avatar scale would be useful for computing multipliers for things such as speed. The ability to get the default avatar height would allow us to define multipliers which are only changed if the user changes their avatar scale, otherwise if they stay in their default height the multiplier would end up being 1.",
